#: 6ea165c8d17b40fcbd8cd81ae5e0d6fb
msgid "嵌入模块"
msgstr "Embedding Modules"

#: 7f790c5dbcff4b509911eba433d8bcec
msgid "嵌入层，将标量的原子序数 Z 转换为指定维度的特征向量。"
msgstr "An embedding layer that converts scalar atomic numbers Z into feature vectors of a specified dimension."

#: 0169dd1ca4b74a178e324b426da7d3f0
msgid ""
"该模块结合了两种信息来生成每个元素的嵌入表示： 1. 一个可学习的嵌入矩阵，针对每个原子序数进行优化。 2. "
"基于元素电子结构的线性变换，提供物理上有意义的先验信息。 这两种表示相加，形成最终的元素特征向量。"
msgstr "This module combines two types of information to generate the embedding representation for each element: 1. A learnable embedding matrix, optimized for each atomic number. 2. A linear transformation based on the element's electronic structure, providing physically meaningful prior information. These two representations are added together to form the final element feature vector."

#: 72a62c28035348fa96b9ca21dc5dee9c
msgid "输出特征向量的维度。"
msgstr "The dimension of the output feature vector."

#: 1b93d8b4355b48aaa467343927e169eb 31db797cef27403c9eb636dc7176b649
#: 87ad29af7a694ac8b95aa03f1f423d5b 8d2f34826e3a4db88fcd1db4af7eb092
#: e914b1ebae524104970cadef55cde4ab
msgid "type"
msgstr "type"

#: 4ea6638bc0d04edd861516c13263e172 f8625b45fe8c4457845e57b6f0557865
msgid "int"
msgstr "int"

#: d7fcb5ccff4b47e6a5bcf16528a27520
msgid "支持的最大原子序数。"
msgstr "The maximum supported atomic number."

#: 8fd69e81dd914adca1a7f39977e70768
msgid "存储元素电子结构信息的张量，作为 buffer 注册。"
msgstr "A tensor storing elemental electronic structure information, registered as a buffer."

#: cbc33fd86bf547a5b8002a9a68f97872
msgid "torch.Tensor"
msgstr "torch.Tensor"

#: 71431305661a4abebb8fce384a547e06
msgid "可学习的元素嵌入矩阵，形状为 `(Zmax, num_features)`。"
msgstr "A learnable element embedding matrix with shape `(Zmax, num_features)`."

#: ff0489b1fc374ac4b923e97114ef1dd5
msgid "nn.Parameter"
msgstr "nn.Parameter"

#: 57044f07d04947cbb43b45966ad199b3
msgid "将电子结构向量线性变换到特征空间的层。"
msgstr "A layer that linearly transforms the electronic structure vector to the feature space."

#: e330a52e580640e387fa6f9ed9090f97
msgid "nn.Linear"
msgstr "nn.Linear"

#: dac2450f70b34e408ebb1a31d86f222d
msgid "初始化或重置模型的参数。"
msgstr "Initializes or resets the model's parameters."

#: 7af3a2160e2a4fc28c2b3f2ac7f7b0b5
msgid "对元素嵌入矩阵使用均匀分布进行初始化，对线性层的权重使用正交初始化。"
msgstr "Initializes the element embedding matrix with a uniform distribution and the weights of the linear layer with orthogonal initialization."

#: 61bb616b1de243b4bc15a35e7def3446
msgid "定义模型的前向传播逻辑。"
msgstr "Defines the model's forward propagation logic."

#: e0af638eace24fe8b8979943e4228087
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: 66d52c2c839d47e2bf6cc5c7b958ab81
msgid "输入的原子序数张量，形状为 `(N,)`，其中 N 是原子数。"
msgstr "The input tensor of atomic numbers, with shape `(N,)`, where N is the number of atoms."

#: 8204ee01d6084eb38c76adbe23d6594c
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: 18f1ee3b70d846c9bb3216bf4bff4d7b
msgid "返回每个原子对应的嵌入向量，形状为 `(N, num_features)`。"
msgstr "Returns the embedding vector corresponding to each atom, with shape `(N, num_features)`."

#: cd0b55e201b146428494cb4cdd26b2e2
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr "Return type"

